yered hexagonal sheets held together by weak forces\", \"t\": \"4:14 PM\", \"et\": \"4:19pm\", \"ln\": \"Carbon and its Compounds\", \"qm\": null, \"st\": \"4:14pm\", \"qet\": null, \"qst\": null, \"sub\": \"Science\"}, {\"m\": \"The oxidation state (or oxidation number) of an atom in a molecule is a formal way of tracking how many electrons it has gained or lost compared to its neutral state.\\n\\nIt doesn’t always represent the real charge on the atom, but it’s a useful bookkeeping tool in redox chemistry.\", \"t\": \"4:19 PM\", \"et\": \"4:20pm\", \"ln\": \"Carbon and its Compounds\", \"qm\": null, \"st\": \"4:19pm\", \"qet\": null, \"qst\": null, \"sub\": \"Science\"}]}, \"dat\": \"2026-03-17\", \"day\": \"Tuesday\", \"sci\": {\"h\": [\"Started lesson: Metals and Non-metals - time: 11:50am\", \"Started lesson: Life Processes - time: 4:07pm\"], \"m\": null, \"t\": null, \"ai\": null, \"et\": \"6:33pm\", \"ln\": \"Carbon and its Compounds\", \"qm\": \"9/10\", \"st\": \"4:35pm\", \"wt\": null, \"qet\": \"6:33pm\", \"qst\": \"4:35pm\", \"sub\": null, \"sessions\": [{\"et\": \"11:52am\", \"ln\": null, \"qm\": null, \"st\": null, \"qet\": null, \"qst\": null}, {\"et\": \"4:09pm\", \"ln\": \"Life Processes\", \"qm\": null, \"st\": \"4:07pm\", \"mde\": \"summary\", \"qet\": null, \"qst\": null}, {\"et\": null, \"ln\": \"Carbon and its Compounds\", \"qm\": null, \"st\": \"4:12pm\", \"mde\": \"practice\", \"qet\": null, \"qst\": null}, {\"et\": \"6:33pm\", \"ln\": \"Carbon and its Compounds\", \"qm\": \"9/10\", \"st\": \"4:35pm\", \"mde\": \"quiz\", \"qet\": \"6:33pm\", \"qst\": \"4:35pm\"}]}, \"smt\": {\"h\": null, \"m\": null, \"t\": null, \"ai\": null, \"et\": null, \"ln\": null, \"qm\": null, \"st\": null, \"wt\": null, \"qet\": null, \"qst\": null, \"sub\": null}, \"soc\": {\"h\": [\"Started lesson: Gender , Religion And Caste - time: 3:21pm\", \"Started lesson: Forest And Wild Life Resources - time: 3:29pm\"], \"m\": null, \"t\": null, \"ai\": null, \"et\": \"3:32pm\", \"ln\": null, \"qm\": null, \"st\": null, \"wt\": null, \"qet\": null, \"qst\": null, \"sub\": null, \"sessions\": [{\"et\": \"3:22pm\", \"ln\": null, \"qm\": null, \"st\": null, \"qet\": null, \"qst\": null}, {\"et\": \"3:32pm\", \"ln\": null, \"qm\": null, \"st\": null, \"qet\": null, \"qst\": null}]}}',NULL,'2026-03-17 13:07:50'),(178,4,'2026-03-18','{\"m\": {\"h\": null, \"m\": null, \"t\": null, \"ai\": null, \"et\": null, \"ln\": null, \"qm\": null, \"st\": null, \"wt\": null, \"qet\": null, \"qst\": null, \"sub\": null}, \"hm\": {\"h\": null, \"m\": null, \"t\": null, \"ai\": null, \"et\": null, \"ln\": null, \"qm\": null, \"st\": null, \"wt\": null, \"qet\": null, \"qst\": null, \"sub\": null}, \"pq\": {\"h\": null, \"m\": null, \"t\": null, \"ai\": null, \"et\": \"8:56am\", \"ln\": \"Gender , Religion And Caste\", \"qm\": null, \"st\": \"8:52am\", \"wt\": null, \"qet\": null, \"qst\": null, \"sub\": \"Social\", \"sessions\": [{\"m\": \"Practice questions for Gender , Religion And Caste\", \"t\": \"None\", \"et\": \"8:44am\", \"ln\": \"Gender , Religion And Caste\", \"qm\": null, \"st\": \"8:40am\", \"qet\": null, \"qst\": null, \"sub\": \"Social\"}, {\"m\": \"Communalism in religious contexts prioritizes loyalty to one’s religious community, often elevating its identity above others, while secular states emphasize neutrality, equality, and separation of religion from governance. In practice, communalism fosters exclusivity and division, whereas secularism seeks inclusivity and impartiality in societal organization.\", \"t\": \"8:44 AM\", \"et\": \"8:47am\", \"ln\": \"Gender , Religion And Caste\", \"qm\": null, \"st\": \"8:44am\", \"qet\": null, \"qst\": null, \"sub\": \"Social\"}, {\"m\": \"Secularism ensures that religion and state remain separate, meaning governments do not privilege or enforce religious doctrines. This separation protects freedom of belief, ensures equality among citizens, and limits religious influence in public policy, though it also reshapes how religious practices appear in public life.\", \"t\": \"8:47 AM\", \"et\": \"8:52am\", \"ln\": \"Gender , Religion And Caste\", \"qm\": null, \"st\": \"8:47am\", \"qet\": null, \"qst\": null, \"sub\": \"Social\"}, {\"m\": \"When communalism is practiced within a secular state, conflicts arise because religious identity begins to dominate political and social life, undermining the principle of neutrality. These conflicts manifest as electoral polarization, discriminatory policies, and social tensions between communities, often destabilizing governance and weakening national unity.\", \"t\": \"8:52 AM\", \"et\": \"8:56am\", \"ln\": \"Gender , Religion And Caste\", \"qm\": null, \"st\": \"8:52am\", \"qet\": null, \"qst\": null, \"sub\": \"Social\"}]}, \"dat\": \"2026-03-18\", \"day\": \"Wednesday\", \"sci\": {\"h\": [\"Started lesson: Sustainable Management of Natural Resources - time: 8:31am\"], \"m\": null, \"t\": null, \"ai\": null, \"et\": \"4:15pm\", \"ln\": \"Metals and Non-metals\", \"qm\": \"8/10\", \"st\": \"3:08pm\", \"wt\": null, \"qet\": \"4:15pm\", \"qst\": \"3:08pm\", \"sub\": null, \"sessions\": [{\"et\": \"8:34am\", \"ln\": \"Sustainable Management of Natural Resources\", \"qm\": null, \"st\": \"8:31am\", \"mde\": \"summary\", \"qet\": null, \"qst\": null}, {\"et\": \"4:15pm\", \"ln\": \"Metals and Non-metals\", \"qm\": \"8/10\", \"st\": \"3:08pm\", \"mde\": \"quiz\", \"qet\": \"4:15pm\", \"qst\": \"3:08pm\"}]}, \"smt\": {\"h\": null, \"m\": null, \"t\": null, \"ai\": null, \"et\": null, \"ln\": null, \"qm\": null, \"st\": null, \"wt\": null, \"qet\": null, \"qst\": null, \"sub\": null}, \"soc\": {\"h\": null, \"m\": null, \"t\": null, \"ai\": null, \"et\": null, \"ln\": \"Gender , Religion And Caste\", \"qm\": null, \"st\": \"8:40am\", \"wt\": null, \"qet\": null, \"qst\": null, \"sub\": null, \"sessions\": [{\"et\": null, \"ln\": \"Gender , Religion And Caste\", \"qm\": null, \"st\": \"8:40am\", \"mde\": \"practice\", \"qet\": null, \"